# Review discipline

Two protocols check the writing on this site before it is published: Ismail's Credibility Checker, which tests whether a claim is well supported, and Ismail AI Review, which looks for the marks of machine-generated prose and removes them. Both are packaged as Claude Skills in the [IsmailsProtocols](https://github.com/M-Ismail-ZA/IsmailsProtocols) repository, and the field's [review discipline page](https://decisional-integrity.github.io/Field/tools/review-discipline/) describes them.
